abstract: >-
  A Claude Code plugin and three portable Agent Skills that set a project's bearing
  (Scope, Standard, Context, Constraints, Problem, Tools) grounded in the project's own
  evidence, flag drift from it on every prompt, check whether the bearing itself still
  matches reality, and record deliberate, PM-confirmed course changes in an append-only logbook.
